WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.920
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:10.480
SPEAKER: Let's start with
an existing GCP project,

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.970
then open the IAM page
on the GCP console

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:15.280
from the top left
navigation menu.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.442
Up at the top, click Add.

00:00:17.442 --> 00:00:19.150
Enter the email address
for a new person,

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:22.120
someone not already in
the access list shown.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.190
Then you can choose what
role to add them to.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.642
I'm picking Storage Admin.

00:00:25.642 --> 00:00:27.100
That will give this
account control

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.070
over Cloud storage resources.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:33.310
Now, switch to the
account you just added.

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.953
At first, I have no permissions
to see storage resources.

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:37.120
Permissions are propagating.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.100
It just takes a few seconds.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.530
After a reload, I can see
the photo I stored earlier,

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:42.950
because I'm Storage Admin.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.440
I can modify or delete the file.

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.380
If I remove that member
from the IAM list,

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.213
the account loses permissions.

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.620
Reloading the
storage browser page,

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.953
I get a permissions error,
because the account no longer

00:00:56.953 --> 00:00:59.710
is allowed to view
storage resources.

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:03.060
[MUSIC PLAYING]

